{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2021-06-04 13:59:00', 'title': 'GARMIN® SHAREHOLDERS APPROVE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND THROUGH MARCH 2022 AND GARMIN ANNOUNCES RECORD DATE AND PAYMENT DATE FOR JUNE 2021 DIVIDEND INSTALLMENT', 'text': "SCHAFFHAUSEN, SWITZERLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AT GARMIN LTD.'S (NASDAQ:GRMN) ANNUAL SHAREHOLDERS' MEETING HELD TODAY, APPROVAL WAS RECEIVED FROM THE SHAREHOLDERS IN ACCORDANCE WITH SWISS CORPORATE LAW FOR A CASH DIVIDEND IN THE AMOUNT OF $2.68 PER SHARE (SUBJECT TO ADJUSTMENT IN THE EVENT THAT THE SWISS FRANC WEAKENS MORE THAN 35% RELATIVE TO THE USD), PAYABLE IN FOUR EQUAL INSTALLMENTS. THE BOARD HAS DETERMINED THAT THE JUNE INSTALLMENT OF THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID AS INDICATED BELOW AND CURRENT"}